�O Rolant Ntesein, anazetontas panta ton Mauro Purgo, taxideuei pros ta notioanatolika mesa apo ta dase tou Mesou Kosmou, mazi me tous tesseris ka-tet tou: ton Enti Ntin kai te gunaika tou Souzana, ton Tzeik Tseimpers, to agori pou perase duo phores apo ten porta tou thanatou ston kosmo tou Rolant, kai ton Ori, ton trauliste.
O dromos tous tha tous bgalei sten koilada tes Kala Mprin Stertzis, mia galenias koinotetas agroton kai ktenotrophon, sten paramuthenia periokhe tou Mesou Kosmou. Pera apo ten pole, upsonetai o skoteinos ogkos tou bounou tes Brontes, pege tromeron deinon gia ten koinoteta, pou ligo, ligo apomuzoun ten psukhe tes.
Ekei tha sunantesoun ton patera Kalakhan, enan katestrammeno ierea, pou ekhei ki ekeinos diabei apo mia "porta" ston kosmo tou Rolant. Kathos tous existorei ta apisteuta gegonota pou sunebesan meta ten exeutelistike anakhorese tou apo to Mein to 1977, ginetai phanere e skhese tou me ton Mauro Purgo, kathos kai o kindunos pou apeilei ena monadiko kokkino triantaphullo s' ena adeio oikopedo tou Mankhatan.
Tautokhrona omos, o phobos puknonei san sunnepho kataigidas pano apo ten Kala. Plesiazei e ora pou tha xanarthoun oi Lukoi tes Brontes, gia na epidothoun kai pali ste phrikte leelasia tous. Opoios thelesei na tous antistathei, riskarei ta panta, alla oi pistoleroi einai sunthismenoi se tetoies pithanotetes kai apophasizoun na meinoun kai na boethesoun tous tromokratemenous katoikous. Ostoso suntoma tha diapistosoun oti ta opla tous den einai arketa...
Kai o Purgos einai tora pio konta..."�
�
Enas kometes sto khroma tou aimatos skizei tous ouranous ton Epta Basileion, enas dusoionos propompos thanatou kai katastrophes. Kathos o kheimonas erkhetai, oi mnesteres tou Sidereniou Thronou einai apophasismenoi na polemesoun me photia kai atsali gia ten kuriarkhia tes dikhasmenes ges tou Gouesteros.
To deutero biblio tes epikes seiras, pou ekhei timethei me tria brabeia Locus, ekhei metaphrastei se perissoteres apo deka glosses ki ekhei poulesei ekatommuria antitupa pagkosmios.
"Alethina epiko... e ploke klimakonetai se ena kresento drases. Mia pragmatike pandaisia gia tous latreis tes logotekhnias tou phantastikou."
(Publishers Weekly)"�
�Bostone, telos tou A Pagkosmiou polemou.
Mia epokhe politikon kai koinonikon anatarakhon. Oi EPA sto staurodromi parelthontos kai mellontos.
Duo anthropoi, enas leukos kai enas mauros, parasurontai apo ton anemostrobilo tes Istorias. O protos, o astuphulakas Ntani Kophlin, paroti organonetai ste sundikalistike omada ton astunomikon, upokhreonetai na parei meros sto kunegi epikindunon rizospaston. O deuteros, o Louther Lorens, dolophonei ena aphentiko tou egklematos sten Talsa kai katapheugei ste Bostone, opou briskei ergasia sten oikogeneia Kophlin. Ten idia stigme prospathei apegnosmena na brei tropo na epistrepsei sten egkuo gunaika tou.
Mesa apo te diadrome ton duo eroon xediplonontai ta krisima gegonota pou semadepsan ten Amerike tou Mesopolemou: e anaptuxe tou sundikalistikou kinematos, e sugkrouse ton ergaton me to kephalaio, o agonas gia ta politika dikaiomata ton Aphroamerikanon. E ploke koruphonetai kata ten apergia tes astunomias tes Bostones to 1919, otan sta gepeda tou mpeizmpol mesouranei o thrulikos Mpeimp Routh.
Sunteretikoi kai epanastates, aristokrates kai laikoi, ntopioi kai metanastes, diephtharmenoi politikoi kai ekprosopoi tou nomou ston kathemerino mokhtho gia ten epibiose kai ste diapale gia ten exousia.
Ena sunarpastiko politikokoinoniko astunomiko muthistorema pou diereuna ten exontotike bia kai ton anexelegkto enthousiasmo mias khoras pou brisketai se diarke polemo me ton eauto tes."�
�E istoria enos anthropou, pou e piestike anagke tou gia apanteseis ton phernei antimetopo me ten akatamakhete duname tes proodou. Prokeitai gia ten istoria tou Mparton Tzortz Ntoz o opoios brisketai pagideumenos apo anapanteta giati. O Ntoz den xerei giati: giati o gios tou, o Tsarli, pethane apo ogko ston egkephalo giati den ekanan alla paidia me te gunaika tou giati e kubernese apophasise ten epektase enos autokinetodromou pou tha sarosei sto perasma tou to spiti opou o Tsarli pethane*giati ta Erga Odopoiias tha katastrepsoun to katharisterio"�
�O Stiben Kingk epistrephei stous kharakteres kai tis topothesies enos apo ta pio demophile erga tou, tes <>, se touto to kataigistiko muthistorema opou sunantame ton meselika pia Ntan Torans kai ena polu xekhoristo dodekakhrono koritsi pou prepei na sosei apo mia summoria paraphusikon dolophonon.
Stous megalous autokinetodromous tes Amerikes, mia omada pou apokaleitai O Alethinos Desmos taxideuei me autokinoumena trokhospita anazetontas trophe. Ta mele tes deikhnoun akakoi, sunethismenoi anthropoi, elikiomenoi oi perissoteroi. Opos omos xerei o Ntan Torans, kai anakaluptei e tharralea mikre Ampra Stooun, einai skhedon athanatoi kai zoun me ton <>pou paragoun ta paidia pou ekhoun te <>otan thanatonontai arga kai basanistika.
Stoikheiomenos apo tous enoikous tou Ksenodokheiou E Thea opou perase mia phrikalea khronia otan etan paidi, o Ntan trigurizei askopa epi dekaeties, prospathontas apegnosmena na apallagei apo ten kleronomia tes apelpisias, tou alkoolismou kai tes bias pou tou aphese o pateras tou. Katalegei se mia komopole tou Niou Khamsair, se mia koinoteta ton AA pou ton sterizei, kai se mia douleia se enan oiko eugerias, opou me ose duname lampses tou ekhei apomeinei prospherei ten ustate anakouphise stous etoimothanatous. Ginetai giA autous o <>.
Mekhri pou gnorizei ten Ampra Stooun... To theamatiko kharisma tes, e pio dunate lampse pou ekhei uparxei pote, xupnaei tous daimones tou Ntan kai ton kalei se mia makhe gia te soteria tes psukhes tes Ampra kai tes zoes tes. Prokeitai gia enan epiko polemo anamesa sto kalo kai to kako, mia aimatere, megaleiode istoria pou tha sunarpasei ta ekatommuria ton aphosiomenon anagnoston tes <>kai tha ikanopoiesei kathe neophermeno sto sumpan tou ergou tou Stiben Kingk."�
�This significant critical anthology explores the life of Anna Komnene, the Byzantine context in which she wrote, and the impact of the Alexiad on her times and on subsequent historical works of literature."�
�"Ta mona pragmata pou arnoumai na emporeuto edo mesa einai ta opla kai ta sklera narkotika. Den ekho skopo na boetheso kanenan na pethanei e na skotosei kapoion allon. Ekho tosous thanatous mesa mou, pou mou phtanoun gia ole mou te zoe...""�
�Mesa apo te lailapa ton megalon bombardismon tou Londinou, o Gkrakham Gkren sullegei ta kommatia, gi' auto, pou tha prepei n' apotelei ten pio phantasmagorike spoude tou pano ston tromo.
To mualo tou Arthour Roou ekhei sunthlibei apo ten enokhe -mia enokhe pou e aitia tes tha prepei na entopistei sto oti dolophonese o idios, apo oikto, ten arroste gunaika tou. Menei exo apo ton polemo o Arthour Roou, mekhri pou apo tukhe manteuei -kai sosta kai lathos- to baros kapoiou keik kata te diarkeia mias philanthropikes giortes. Apo ten stigme ekeine ginetai e leia upoulon kai skoteinon dunameon, pou arkhizoun na ton katadiokoun aneleeta, kai apo tis opoies agonizetai na xephugei me ena mualo, pou ekhei papsei pia na leitourgei sosta.
